5488cf5b5e82dd34d265c1567c (4.5-dev4+)\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10.0.20348, macOS 15.4.1\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn release exports, capturing script backtraces reports incorrect line numbers for GDScript, always pointing to the function signature. Backtraces in release builds can be enabled with `always_track_call_stacks` in the project setting.\n\nRelated PR:\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91006\n\n### Detailed explanation\n\nConsider this code:\n\n<img width=\"675\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b1886c6-f3c7-43c6-8272-dd75f9cd4b92\" />\n\nUsing `editor` build:\n```\ndebug build: true\nentering f1()\nentering f2()\nentering f3()\nGDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\n    [0] f3 (res://main.gd:21)\n    [1] f2 (res://main.gd:16)\n    [2] f1 (res://main.gd:11)\n    [3] _ready (res://main.gd:6)\n```\n\nUsing `tempate_release` build:\n```\ndebug build: false\nentering f1()\nentering f2()\nentering f3()\nGDScript backtrace (most recent call first):\n    [0] f3 (res://main.gd:19)\n    [1] f2 (res://main.gd:14)\n    [2] f1 (res://main.gd:9)\n    [3] _ready (res://main.gd:4)\n```\n\nNote how frame line numbers are pointing to the function signatures when running with a release template build.\n\n#### The problem manifesting in `sentry-godot` GDExtension:\n\nScript stack trace produced using `editor` build:\n<img width=\"917\" alt=\"script-stack-trace-editor\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c45d2fe-6240-4e53-b79d-26865ec8dd0f\" />\n\nScript stack trace produced using `template_release` build:\n<img width=\"916\" alt=\"script-stack-trace-release\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e82365d-5d64-4b0f-91ff-bd0932cf9332\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun MRP using `editor` build and then using `template_release` build. Compare the console outputs.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[reproduce-release-backtrace-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20241955/reproduce-release-backtrace-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106484/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106484/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}